| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/reference_source_hashes.json` | 1,796 file, `source_mutation_performed=false` | package별 source SHA-256 |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/reference/levels` | 59/59 complete, truncation 0, mutation 0 | actor/component 직렬화 사용 |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/reference/materials` | 963 catalog + 999 page, digest `f2d623032d8decdefaaaffc8cb755c7559655705748542ecf2611ee18d8c10df` | 167 texture/volume owner reach |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/reference/animation` | 62 catalog, 68 inspector output, error/truncation/mutation 0 | 53 motion 분류와 skeletal/physics 관계 |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/reference/support` | BlendSpace, GeometryCollection 등 bounded support inspection | recipe 또는 explicit localization exception |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLiveStudy/target/art/20260901_material_textures_localize_v001/art_localization_report.json` | 172/172 created/saved, verification/dependency independence PASS | 1차 실제 지역화 정본 |
| `MCPGameProject/Saved/MCP/CubeFluidNinjaLive_content_root_audit_report.json` | Study 173 asset, forbidden/redirector/dirty 0 | 172 art + NiagaraSystem 1 post-root audit |
| `concepts/material-semantic-map.md` | 167 art candidate, direct 32/319 occurrence | material-side texture closure |
| `concepts/animation-skeletal-observation.md` | runtime motion 28, legacy 6, unproven 19 | animation execution closure |

문서의 offline string audit는 각 허용 class `.uasset`에서
`/Game/FluidNinjaLive/...` package string을 추출하고 inventory package에 exact
join했다. 이는 숨은 source reference의 보수적 위험 탐지다. Asset Registry의
hard/soft/searchable/manage dependency 판정은 아니므로 지역화 실행 때 native
dependency dry-run과 save/reload 후 감사를 반드시 다시 수행한다.

